features
	Pizza
		mandatory Base
		mandatory Sauce
			alternative
				Tomato
				CremeFraiche
		optional Cheese
			or
				Mozzarella
				Cheddar
		optional Toppings
			cardinality [1..3]
				Mushrooms
				Onion
				Olive
				Pineapple
		mandatory Size integer
		mandatory Delivery
			cardinality [1..10]
				Street string
				City string
constraints
	Cheddar => !CremeFraiche
	len(Toppings) >= 1
	len(Toppings) <= 3
	len(Delivery) >= 1
	len(Delivery) <= 10
	Size >= 20
	Size <= 60
	City == "Omashu"
	len(Street) <= 100
	(2.0 + (Tomato ? 0.8 : 0) + (CremeFraiche ? 1.1 : 0) + (Mozzarella ? 0.4 : 0) + (Cheddar ? 0.6 : 0) + (Mushrooms ? 0.5 : 0) + (Onion ? 0.3 : 0) + (Olive ? 0.3 : 0) + (Pineapple ? 0.8 : 0)) < 5